# Security

- Authorize server-side; never trust client roles or IDs.
- CSRF on browser cookie mutations; step-up on high-risk actions.
- No passwords/tokens/TOTP/decrypted PII in logs.
- Allowlisted PATCH/PUT keys; unknown → `400` with stable `error.code`.
- Privacy-hidden public profiles → `404` (not `403`) when policy says so.
- Checklist: `docs/security/checklist.md`. Details: `docs/security/authn-authz.md`.
